<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Open Notes – Github-Oauth</title><link>https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/tags/github-oauth/</link><description>Recent content in Github-Oauth on Open Notes</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 01 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/tags/github-oauth/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>DevPage: Social Platform &amp; Collaborative Hub for Developers</title><link>https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/projects/devpage/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/projects/devpage/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/nagarajpoojari404/DevPage" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;View on GitHub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="#full-stack-architecture"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="#tech-stack"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DevPage&lt;/strong&gt; is a dedicated social collaboration and portfolio showcase platform built specifically for software engineers—conceptualized as &amp;ldquo;Instagram for Developers&amp;rdquo;. Rather than generic images and status updates, DevPage centers around syntax-highlighted code snippets, engineering problem breakdowns, architectural post feeds, and developer showcase profiles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="full-stack-architecture"&gt;Full-Stack Architecture&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="full-stack-architecture"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#full-stack-architecture" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div role="img" aria-label="Diagram"&gt;
&lt;pre class="mermaid hx:mt-6"&gt;
flowchart TD
Client[Browser / DevPage Frontend] --&amp;gt; Gateway[Express.js Web Server]
subgraph Auth [Authentication &amp;amp; Identity]
Gateway &amp;lt;--&amp;gt; Cognito[AWS Cognito User Pools]
Gateway &amp;lt;--&amp;gt; GitHubAuth[GitHub OAuth 2.0 via Passport.js]
end
subgraph DataLayer [Storage &amp;amp; Media]
Gateway &amp;lt;--&amp;gt; Mongo[(MongoDB Atlas / Mongoose Models)]
Gateway &amp;lt;--&amp;gt; S3[(AWS S3: Developer Assets &amp;amp; Code Snippets)]
end
Gateway --&amp;gt; Renderer[EJS-Mate SSR Engine / Interactive Views]
Renderer --&amp;gt; Client
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="key-capabilities"&gt;Key Capabilities&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="key-capabilities"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#key-capabilities" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rich Code &amp;amp; Media Sharing&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create technical posts embedding syntax-highlighted code blocks across 50+ programming languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attach system architecture diagrams and flowcharts directly to technical write-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dual Authentication &amp;amp; Security&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrated with &lt;strong&gt;GitHub OAuth 2.0&lt;/strong&gt; for one-click developer signup and automatic repository linking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise-grade user pool management via &lt;strong&gt;AWS Cognito&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer Profile &amp;amp; Portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customizable profile showcasing GitHub statistics, featured repositories, technical skill tags, and published articles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real-time comment threads on code snippets, upvoting, tag filtering, and technical bookmarking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="tech-stack"&gt;Tech Stack&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="tech-stack"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#tech-stack" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: left"&gt;Layer&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: left"&gt;Technology&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Framework&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Node.js, Express.js&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Authentication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;AWS Cognito, Passport.js (&lt;code&gt;passport-github2&lt;/code&gt;), Express-Session&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Database&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;MongoDB Atlas, Mongoose ODM&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Storage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;AWS S3 / AWS SDK&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Templating / UI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;EJS-Mate, Bootstrap 5, Prism.js (Syntax Highlighting)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="running-locally"&gt;Running Locally&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="running-locally"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#running-locally" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Clone the repository&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git clone https://github.com/nagarajpoojari404/DevPage.git
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; DevPage
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Install dependencies&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;npm install
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Configure environment variables (.env)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;cp .env.example .env
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Set DB_URL, GITHUB_CLIENT_ID, GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET, AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID, AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Start development server with Nodemon&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;npm start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>